    "Real ninth independent module obtains a five-field source snapshot; unchanged explicit size edits cannot produce an applicable review. Cancel preserves disk and draft.",
    "Full original-preserving native candidate is reviewed with explicit fields, identities and net paths; 390 px Chinese/English/Japanese retain the exact form and approval without horizontal overflow.",
    "Apply advances source ownership, updates only the unsaved raw draft and closes safely. The old readonly preview renders the new transform without a write port or implicit Save.",
    "Ordinary source Save writes exactly the reviewed BOM/CRLF bytes, keeps all stable object IDs and unselected source, and clears the dirty state.",
    "Editing the actual raw source while a checked field form remains open invalidates Apply; the newer draft and saved author file remain intact.",
    "External saved-file changes remain protected by the ordinary Save precondition after field Apply. The newer external file and unsaved candidate both survive a rejected Save.",
    "With WebGL2 explicitly unavailable, the readonly preview reports its rendering limit while native 3D field review remains usable; cancellation leaves the author file intact."
